[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6009863927","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124149#issuecomment-6009863927","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124149","id":6009863927,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZjc-9w","user":{"login":"Schnorg","id":44937651,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTM3NjUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44937651?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg","html_url":"https://github.com/Schnorg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Schnorg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-06T05:18:54Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T05:18:54Z","body":"I have been digging into this today. \r\n\r\nThe first issue I have is that I can't get the MRP to fail with Godot Physics, only with Bullet (which is also DEFAULT for 3.x I believe).\r\n\r\nI also upgraded the MRP to 4.7.2, and I can't get it to fail with either Godot Physics or with Jolt. \r\n\r\nI tried my own CharacterBody2D MRP for this also in 4.x and couldn't get it to fail to wake. \r\n\r\nIs this only a Bullet issue? or am I doing something wrong? \r\n\r\nI run the MRP, I wait 10 seconds, and then I move the KinematicBody (CharacterBody3D in 4.x) into the RigidBody. With Bullet, the RigidBody will not wake, but with every other engine it does wake.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6009863927/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6011931625","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124149#issuecomment-6011931625","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124149","id":6011931625,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZlbL6Q","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-06T07:56:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T07:58:52Z","body":"> The first issue I have is that I can't get the MRP to fail with Godot Physics, only with Bullet (which is also DEFAULT for 3.x I believe).\r\n\r\nI double checked and you are right!\r\nThe confusion is that I had thought that DEFAULT had been Godot Physics, but at some point we swapped it out for Bullet as default. So I can just remove the Godot Physics change I expect. I'll take a look.\r\n\r\nAnd if so that's good news if no changes are required for 4.x.\r\n\r\nIn which case, there may be a greater argument for just _fixing_ it in Bullet, and not adding the extra `body_set_transform()` function. I'll take a look. :+1: \r\n\r\nIf so, I'll likely close this PR and open a simpler one just with the fix for `Bullet`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6011931625/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6012405174","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124149#issuecomment-6012405174","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124149","id":6012405174,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZl4Ftg","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-06T08:27:42Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T08:27:42Z","body":"Closing in favour of #124215 as it looks like we can use a simpler appr